<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Payables Aging and Payment Run: the paginated drill target behind the Days
     to Pay by Terms tile on the Franchise Treasury console. Every unsettled
     supplier invoice up to the as-of month, grouped by supplier, with a
     per-bucket subtotal under each supplier, a supplier x bucket matrix, a
     proposed payment run, the settlement speed by terms, and the early-pay
     discount already banked.

     PARAMETERS - p_asof is a yyyymm String (the shared LOV control), p_regions
     is a java.util.Collection so the shared multi-select control feeds
     $X{IN, ...}. Supplier invoices carry a region but no franchisee, so
     p_franchisee is not a parameter here (same rule the Days to Pay tile
     follows). An empty collection makes $X{IN} expand to a no-op TRUE.

     DESIGN NOTES:

     1. "Paid" is 0.00 on every printed row by construction: the query keeps
        only status <> 'Paid', and the ledger books the settled amount only
        when the invoice settles, so an unsettled invoice has nothing applied
        against it and its balance equals the invoiced amount. The column is
        kept to mirror the Receivables Aging statement and to show a reader
        that no part payment has landed.

     2. Bucket ordering. The summary crosstab buckets its columns on the CASE
        rank the query computes (bucket_ord), not on the bucket label: a
        crosstab bucket sorts on its own value, so bucketing on the label would
        print 1-30 days / 31-60 days / 60+ days / Current alphabetically with
        Current stranded on the right. The column header maps the rank back to
        its label.

     3. The payment run is a subDataset, because it applies a different filter
        from the main query (due within 14 days of the as-of month end) and so
        cannot be derived from the printed rows. The as-of month end comes from
        the calendar, not from a hard-coded date, so the section follows the
        as-of control. The early-pay discount rate is NOT invented: it is read
        back from settlement history as the highest rate ever actually granted
        on each terms class (2.00 pct on Net 30, 1.00 pct on Net 45 and Net
        60), so the "discount available" column is the rate the supplier has
        demonstrably honoured applied to the balance now falling due. Every
        open invoice qualifies for a discount under those terms, so the
        14-day window is what selects the run.

     4. Three subDatasets are rendered as minimal crosstabs rather than as a
        repeating text block. JasperReports' list and table components are not
        registered on this JR7 classpath (the Jackson loader rejects
        kind="list" outright), so a crosstab and a chart are the only
        JR7-native ways to iterate a subDataset inside a band, and a crosstab
        is the right shape for a labelled figure.

     5. Deviation from the task brief's discounts SQL: the region predicate
        was added. Every other block on the page honours the region control,
        and without it the discounts figure would contradict the rest of the
        page whenever a region is selected.

     6. Summary layout. A band's DESIGN height may not exceed the printable
        page height, and the four stacked blocks need roughly 670px at their
        full row counts, so each crosstab is designed short and every element
        after the first carries positionType="Float". A floating element is
        pushed down by whatever the elements above it stretched, so the blocks
        stay in order and the band grows past the page and splits, instead of
        the crosstabs overprinting the captions below them.

     JR7-native throughout: <query language="SQL">, <element kind="...">,
     <element kind="crosstab"> with <rowGroup>/<columnGroup>/<measure>/<cell>,
     sub-datasets as top-level <dataset name="..."> driven by <datasetRun>. -->
<jasperReport name="rpt_ap_aging" language="java" pageWidth="842" pageHeight="595" orientation="Landscape" columnWidth="782" leftMargin="30" rightMargin="30" topMargin="30" bottomMargin="30" whenNoDataType="AllSectionsNoDetail">

	<style name="ap_cell" fontSize="8.0" forecolor="#1F4E79"/>
	<style name="ap_cell_aged" fontSize="8.0" forecolor="#1F4E79">
		<conditionalStyle forecolor="#D9534F">
			<conditionExpression><![CDATA[$F{days_overdue} != null && $F{days_overdue}.intValue() > 0]]></conditionExpression>
		</conditionalStyle>
	</style>
	<style name="ap_grp_60" fontSize="9.0" forecolor="#1F4E79">
		<conditionalStyle forecolor="#D9534F">
			<conditionExpression><![CDATA[$V{grp_b60p} != null && $V{grp_b60p}.signum() > 0]]></conditionExpression>
		</conditionalStyle>
	</style>

	<dataset name="ds_payrun">
		<parameter name="p_asof" class="java.lang.String"/>
		<parameter name="p_regions" class="java.util.Collection"/>
		<query language="SQL"><![CDATA[
SELECT a.supplier_name, a.payment_terms, INT4(COUNT(*)) AS invoices,
       DECIMAL(SUM(a.balance), 14, 2) AS due_amount,
       DECIMAL(SUM(a.balance) * MAX(r.rate), 14, 2) AS discount_available,
       MIN(a.due_date) AS earliest_due
FROM ap_invoices a
JOIN (SELECT payment_terms, MAX(FLOAT8(discount_taken) / FLOAT8(NULLIF(amount, 0))) AS rate
      FROM ap_invoices WHERE discount_taken > 0 GROUP BY payment_terms) r ON r.payment_terms = a.payment_terms
WHERE a.status <> 'Paid' AND a.invoice_yyyymm <= INT4($P{p_asof})
  AND a.due_date > (SELECT MAX(calendar_date) FROM date_dim WHERE yyyymm = INT4($P{p_asof}))
  AND a.due_date <= (SELECT MAX(calendar_date) FROM date_dim WHERE yyyymm = INT4($P{p_asof})) + 14
  AND $X{IN, a.region, p_regions}
GROUP BY a.supplier_name, a.payment_terms
ORDER BY a.supplier_name
		]]></query>
		<field name="supplier_name" class="java.lang.String"/>
		<field name="payment_terms" class="java.lang.String"/>
		<field name="invoices" class="java.lang.Integer"/>
		<field name="due_amount" class="java.math.BigDecimal"/>
		<field name="discount_available" class="java.math.BigDecimal"/>
		<field name="earliest_due" class="java.sql.Date"/>
	</dataset>

	<dataset name="ds_dpo">
		<parameter name="p_asof" class="java.lang.String"/>
		<parameter name="p_regions" class="java.util.Collection"/>
		<query language="SQL"><![CDATA[
SELECT payment_terms, DECIMAL(AVG(FLOAT8(days_to_pay)), 6, 1) AS dpo_days
FROM ap_invoices WHERE status = 'Paid' AND invoice_yyyymm <= INT4($P{p_asof}) AND $X{IN, region, p_regions}
GROUP BY payment_terms ORDER BY payment_terms
		]]></query>
		<field name="payment_terms" class="java.lang.String"/>
		<field name="dpo_days" class="java.math.BigDecimal"/>
	</dataset>

	<dataset name="ds_discounts">
		<parameter name="p_asof" class="java.lang.String"/>
		<parameter name="p_regions" class="java.util.Collection"/>
		<query language="SQL"><![CDATA[
SELECT DECIMAL(SUM(discount_taken), 14, 2) AS d
FROM ap_invoices WHERE status = 'Paid' AND invoice_yyyymm <= INT4($P{p_asof}) AND $X{IN, region, p_regions}
		]]></query>
		<field name="d" class="java.math.BigDecimal"/>
	</dataset>

	<parameter name="p_asof" class="java.lang.String">
		<defaultValueExpression><![CDATA["202012"]]></defaultValueExpression>
	</parameter>
	<parameter name="p_regions" class="java.util.Collection"/>

	<query language="SQL"><![CDATA[
SELECT a.supplier_name, a.invoice_number, a.po_number, a.storenumber, a.region, a.invoice_date, a.due_date, a.payment_terms, a.status, a.aging_bucket,
       a.amount, a.amount_paid, a.balance, a.days_overdue, s.payment_terms AS supplier_terms,
       CASE a.aging_bucket WHEN 'Current' THEN 1 WHEN '1-30 days' THEN 2 WHEN '31-60 days' THEN 3 ELSE 4 END AS bucket_ord
FROM ap_invoices a LEFT JOIN suppliers s ON s.supplier_name = a.supplier_name
WHERE a.status <> 'Paid' AND a.invoice_yyyymm <= INT4($P{p_asof}) AND $X{IN, a.region, p_regions}
ORDER BY a.supplier_name, bucket_ord DESC, a.due_date
	]]></query>

	<field name="supplier_name" class="java.lang.String"/>
	<field name="invoice_number" class="java.lang.String"/>
	<field name="po_number" class="java.lang.String"/>
	<field name="storenumber" class="java.lang.Integer"/>
	<field name="region" class="java.lang.String"/>
	<field name="invoice_date" class="java.sql.Date"/>
	<field name="due_date" class="java.sql.Date"/>
	<field name="payment_terms" class="java.lang.String"/>
	<field name="status" class="java.lang.String"/>
	<field name="aging_bucket" class="java.lang.String"/>
	<field name="amount" class="java.math.BigDecimal"/>
	<field name="amount_paid" class="java.math.BigDecimal"/>
	<field name="balance" class="java.math.BigDecimal"/>
	<field name="days_overdue" class="java.lang.Integer"/>
	<field name="supplier_terms" class="java.lang.String"/>
	<field name="bucket_ord" class="java.lang.Integer"/>

	<variable name="grp_balance" class="java.math.BigDecimal" calculation="Sum" resetType="Group" resetGroup="supplier">
		<expression><![CDATA[$F{balance}]]></expression>
	</variable>
	<variable name="grp_current" class="java.math.BigDecimal" calculation="Sum" resetType="Group" resetGroup="supplier">
		<expression><![CDATA["Current".equals($F{aging_bucket}) ? $F{balance} : java.math.BigDecimal.ZERO]]></expression>
	</variable>
	<variable name="grp_b1_30" class="java.math.BigDecimal" calculation="Sum" resetType="Group" resetGroup="supplier">
		<expression><![CDATA["1-30 days".equals($F{aging_bucket}) ? $F{balance} : java.math.BigDecimal.ZERO]]></expression>
	</variable>
	<variable name="grp_b31_60" class="java.math.BigDecimal" calculation="Sum" resetType="Group" resetGroup="supplier">
		<expression><![CDATA["31-60 days".equals($F{aging_bucket}) ? $F{balance} : java.math.BigDecimal.ZERO]]></expression>
	</variable>
	<variable name="grp_b60p" class="java.math.BigDecimal" calculation="Sum" resetType="Group" resetGroup="supplier">
		<expression><![CDATA["60+ days".equals($F{aging_bucket}) ? $F{balance} : java.math.BigDecimal.ZERO]]></expression>
	</variable>

	<variable name="rpt_balance" class="java.math.BigDecimal" calculation="Sum">
		<expression><![CDATA[$F{balance}]]></expression>
	</variable>
	<variable name="rpt_overdue_bal" class="java.math.BigDecimal" calculation="Sum">
		<expression><![CDATA["Overdue".equals($F{status}) ? $F{balance} : java.math.BigDecimal.ZERO]]></expression>
	</variable>
	<variable name="rpt_open_n" class="java.lang.Integer" calculation="Sum">
		<expression><![CDATA["Open".equals($F{status}) ? Integer.valueOf(1) : Integer.valueOf(0)]]></expression>
	</variable>
	<variable name="rpt_overdue_n" class="java.lang.Integer" calculation="Sum">
		<expression><![CDATA["Overdue".equals($F{status}) ? Integer.valueOf(1) : Integer.valueOf(0)]]></expression>
	</variable>

	<group name="supplier">
		<expression><![CDATA[$F{supplier_name}]]></expression>
		<groupHeader>
			<band height="22">
				<element kind="rectangle" x="0" y="2" width="782" height="18" mode="Opaque" backcolor="#D6E0EF" forecolor="#D6E0EF"/>
				<element kind="textField" x="6" y="2" width="520" height="18" fontSize="10.0" bold="true" forecolor="#1F4E79" vTextAlign="Middle">
					<expression><![CDATA[$F{supplier_name}]]></expression>
				</element>
				<element kind="textField" x="532" y="2" width="244" height="18" fontSize="9.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle">
					<expression><![CDATA[$F{supplier_terms} == null ? "" : ("standard terms " + $F{supplier_terms})]]></expression>
				</element>
			</band>
		</groupHeader>
		<groupFooter>
			<band height="38">
				<element kind="line" x="0" y="1" width="782" height="1" forecolor="#1F4E79"/>
				<element kind="staticText" x="282" y="3" width="98" height="12" fontSize="7.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Right"><text><![CDATA[Current]]></text></element>
				<element kind="staticText" x="382" y="3" width="98" height="12" fontSize="7.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Right"><text><![CDATA[1-30 days]]></text></element>
				<element kind="staticText" x="482" y="3" width="98" height="12" fontSize="7.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Right"><text><![CDATA[31-60 days]]></text></element>
				<element kind="staticText" x="582" y="3" width="98" height="12" fontSize="7.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Right"><text><![CDATA[60+ days]]></text></element>
				<element kind="staticText" x="682" y="3" width="98" height="12" fontSize="7.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Right"><text><![CDATA[Total payable]]></text></element>

				<element kind="textField" x="6" y="16" width="272" height="16" fontSize="9.0" bold="true" forecolor="#1F4E79" vTextAlign="Middle">
					<expression><![CDATA["Subtotal for " + $F{supplier_name}]]></expression>
				</element>
				<element kind="textField" x="282" y="16" width="98" height="16" fontSize="9.0" forecolor="#1F4E79" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="$#,##0">
					<expression><![CDATA[$V{grp_current}]]></expression>
				</element>
				<element kind="textField" x="382" y="16" width="98" height="16" fontSize="9.0" forecolor="#1F4E79" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="$#,##0">
					<expression><![CDATA[$V{grp_b1_30}]]></expression>
				</element>
				<element kind="textField" x="482" y="16" width="98" height="16" fontSize="9.0" forecolor="#1F4E79" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="$#,##0">
					<expression><![CDATA[$V{grp_b31_60}]]></expression>
				</element>
				<element kind="textField" style="ap_grp_60" x="582" y="16" width="98" height="16" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="$#,##0">
					<expression><![CDATA[$V{grp_b60p}]]></expression>
				</element>
				<element kind="textField" x="682" y="16" width="98" height="16" fontSize="9.0" bold="true" forecolor="#1F4E79" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="$#,##0">
					<expression><![CDATA[$V{grp_balance}]]></expression>
				</element>
				<element kind="line" x="0" y="36" width="782" height="1" forecolor="#D6E0EF"/>
			</band>
		</groupFooter>
	</group>

	<title height="56">
		<element kind="image" x="0" y="0" width="44" height="44" scaleImage="RetainShape" hImageAlign="Left" vImageAlign="Top"><expression><![CDATA["repo:/images/actian_logo"]]></expression></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="0" y="0" width="782" height="24" fontSize="16.0" bold="true" forecolor="#1F4E79" hTextAlign="Center"><text><![CDATA[Payables Aging and Payment Run]]></text></element>
		<element kind="textField" x="0" y="26" width="782" height="14" fontSize="9.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Center">
			<expression><![CDATA["Unsettled supplier invoices in CAD, by supplier. Ledger as of 2020-12-31, invoices through "
+ $P{p_asof}.substring(0, 4) + "-" + $P{p_asof}.substring(4)
+ ". Regions: " + ($P{p_regions} == null || $P{p_regions}.isEmpty() ? "all"
    : $P{p_regions}.toString().replace("[", "").replace("]", ""))]]></expression>
		</element>
		<element kind="line" x="0" y="50" width="782" height="1" forecolor="#D6E0EF"/>
	</title>

	<columnHeader height="20">
		<element kind="rectangle" x="0" y="0" width="782" height="20" mode="Opaque" backcolor="#1F4E79" forecolor="#1F4E79"/>
		<element kind="staticText" x="2" y="0" width="36" height="20" fontSize="8.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Store]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="40" y="0" width="44" height="20" fontSize="8.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Region]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="86" y="0" width="100" height="20" fontSize="8.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Invoice]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="188" y="0" width="78" height="20" fontSize="8.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Purchase order]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="268" y="0" width="44" height="20" fontSize="8.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Terms]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="314" y="0" width="58" height="20" fontSize="8.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Invoiced]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="374" y="0" width="58" height="20" fontSize="8.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Due]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="434" y="0" width="58" height="20" fontSize="8.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Bucket]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="494" y="0" width="76" height="20" fontSize="8.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Amount]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="572" y="0" width="66" height="20" fontSize="8.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Paid]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="640" y="0" width="76" height="20" fontSize="8.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Balance]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="718" y="0" width="60" height="20" fontSize="8.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Days overdue]]></text></element>
	</columnHeader>

	<detail>
		<band height="16">
			<element kind="rectangle" x="0" y="0" width="782" height="16" mode="Opaque" backcolor="#D6E0EF" forecolor="#D6E0EF">
				<printWhenExpression><![CDATA[$V{REPORT_COUNT}.intValue() % 2 == 0]]></printWhenExpression>
			</element>
			<element kind="textField" style="ap_cell" x="2" y="0" width="36" height="16" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="#0">
				<expression><![CDATA[$F{storenumber}]]></expression>
			</element>
			<element kind="textField" style="ap_cell" x="40" y="0" width="44" height="16" vTextAlign="Middle">
				<expression><![CDATA[$F{region}]]></expression>
			</element>
			<element kind="textField" style="ap_cell" x="86" y="0" width="100" height="16" vTextAlign="Middle">
				<expression><![CDATA[$F{invoice_number}]]></expression>
			</element>
			<element kind="textField" style="ap_cell" x="188" y="0" width="78" height="16" vTextAlign="Middle">
				<expression><![CDATA[$F{po_number}]]></expression>
			</element>
			<element kind="textField" style="ap_cell" x="268" y="0" width="44" height="16" vTextAlign="Middle">
				<expression><![CDATA[$F{payment_terms}]]></expression>
			</element>
			<element kind="textField" style="ap_cell" x="314" y="0" width="58" height="16" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="yyyy-MM-dd">
				<expression><![CDATA[$F{invoice_date}]]></expression>
			</element>
			<element kind="textField" style="ap_cell" x="374" y="0" width="58" height="16" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="yyyy-MM-dd">
				<expression><![CDATA[$F{due_date}]]></expression>
			</element>
			<element kind="textField" style="ap_cell_aged" x="434" y="0" width="58" height="16" vTextAlign="Middle">
				<expression><![CDATA[$F{aging_bucket}]]></expression>
			</element>
			<element kind="textField" style="ap_cell" x="494" y="0" width="76" height="16" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="$#,##0.00">
				<expression><![CDATA[$F{amount}]]></expression>
			</element>
			<element kind="textField" style="ap_cell" x="572" y="0" width="66" height="16" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="$#,##0.00">
				<expression><![CDATA[$F{amount_paid}]]></expression>
			</element>
			<element kind="textField" style="ap_cell" x="640" y="0" width="76" height="16" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="$#,##0.00">
				<expression><![CDATA[$F{balance}]]></expression>
			</element>
			<element kind="textField" style="ap_cell_aged" x="718" y="0" width="60" height="16" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="#,##0">
				<expression><![CDATA[$F{days_overdue}]]></expression>
			</element>
		</band>
	</detail>

	<pageFooter height="18">
		<element kind="line" x="0" y="0" width="782" height="1" forecolor="#D6E0EF"/>
		<element kind="textField" x="0" y="4" width="500" height="12" fontSize="8.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6">
			<expression><![CDATA["Payables Aging and Payment Run -- amounts in CAD"]]></expression>
		</element>
		<element kind="textField" x="600" y="4" width="130" height="12" fontSize="8.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Right">
			<expression><![CDATA["Page " + $V{PAGE_NUMBER} + " of"]]></expression>
		</element>
		<element kind="textField" x="732" y="4" width="50" height="12" fontSize="8.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" evaluationTime="Report">
			<expression><![CDATA[" " + $V{PAGE_NUMBER}]]></expression>
		</element>
	</pageFooter>

	<summary height="314">
		<element kind="line" x="0" y="4" width="782" height="1" forecolor="#D6E0EF"/>

		<element kind="staticText" x="0" y="8" width="195" height="20" fontSize="13.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Center" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Total payable]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="196" y="8" width="195" height="20" fontSize="13.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Center" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Overdue balance]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="392" y="8" width="195" height="20" fontSize="13.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Center" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Open invoices]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="588" y="8" width="194" height="20" fontSize="13.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Center" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Overdue invoices]]></text></element>

		<element kind="textField" x="0" y="30" width="195" height="36" fontSize="26.0" bold="true" forecolor="#1F4E79" hTextAlign="Center" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="$#,##0">
			<expression><![CDATA[$V{rpt_balance}]]></expression>
		</element>
		<element kind="textField" x="196" y="30" width="195" height="36" fontSize="26.0" bold="true" forecolor="#D9534F" hTextAlign="Center" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="$#,##0">
			<expression><![CDATA[$V{rpt_overdue_bal}]]></expression>
		</element>
		<element kind="textField" x="392" y="30" width="195" height="36" fontSize="26.0" bold="true" forecolor="#1F4E79" hTextAlign="Center" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="#,##0">
			<expression><![CDATA[$V{rpt_open_n}]]></expression>
		</element>
		<element kind="textField" x="588" y="30" width="194" height="36" fontSize="26.0" bold="true" forecolor="#1F4E79" hTextAlign="Center" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="#,##0">
			<expression><![CDATA[$V{rpt_overdue_n}]]></expression>
		</element>

		<element kind="line" x="0" y="72" width="782" height="1" forecolor="#D6E0EF"/>
		<element kind="staticText" x="0" y="78" width="782" height="14" fontSize="9.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Center"><text><![CDATA[Outstanding balance by supplier and aging bucket (CAD)]]></text></element>

		<element kind="crosstab" x="0" y="96" width="782" height="52">
			<dataset/>
			<rowGroup name="ct_supplier" totalPosition="End" width="222">
				<bucket class="java.lang.String"><expression><![CDATA[$F{supplier_name}]]></expression></bucket>
				<header>
